<title>USA: Wall Street stocks lower in early trade.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks lower in early trade.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks took their cue from a weak bond market and headed lower in early trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The market will closely scrutinise comments by Fed chiarman Greenspan to Congress starting at 1500 GMT.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials Average was down 18 at 6825.</p>
</text>
